ons**:\n    * The system is configured to allow new user sign-ups.\n  - **Test Steps**:\n    1. Navigate to the signup page and enter a valid email address, weak password, and other required fields.\n    2. Click on the "Sign up" button.\n  - **Expected Results**:\n    * An error message is displayed indicating that the password is too weak.\n    * The user is not created or logged in to the system.\n  - **Security Impact**: High\n  - **Edge Cases Covered**: Weak passwords.\n  - **Compliance Checks**:\n    + Verify that the signup page adheres to industry standards for password strength.\n\n### Module: Signup Page\n- **Test Scenario**: Missing Required Fields during Sign-up\n  - **Test Case ID**: TC-SIG-004 \n  - **Priority**: P2 (Medium)\n  - **Preconditions**:\n    * The system is configured to allow new user sign-ups.\n  - **Test Steps**:\n    1. Navigate to the signup page and leave one or more required fields blank.\n    2. Click on the "Sign up" button.\n  - **Expected Results**:\n    * An error message is displayed indicating that one or more required fields are missing.\n    * The user is not created or logged in to the system.\n  - **Security Impact**: Low\n  - **Edge Cases Covered**: Missing required fields.\n  - **Compliance Checks**: None\n\nLet me know if you\'d like me to generate more test scenarios!' context=[128006, 882, 128007, 1432, 262, 3146, 9207, 96618, 19903, 67008, 29483, 58394, 304, 4868, 323, 8907, 7649, 2355, 262, 3146, 6396, 96618, 20400, 16195, 1296, 26350, 369, 279, 2728, 16686, 13, 19124, 262, 3146, 76902, 12051, 334, 512, 262, 3041, 757, 369, 41148, 2199, 271, 262, 3146, 5207, 15392, 334, 512, 262, 17010, 14026, 25, 510, 3413, 4076, 933, 262, 482, 3146, 2323, 59763, 96618, 510, 55131, 7817, 933, 415, 482, 3146, 2323, 11799, 3110, 96618, 25610, 42095, 6277, 60, 720, 415, 482, 3146, 21197, 96618, 393, 15, 320, 43108, 5738, 47, 16, 320, 12243, 5738, 47, 17, 320, 42094, 340, 415, 482, 3146, 4808, 16902, 96618, 720, 415, 482, 3146, 2323, 4